// r04: harp from VSCO 2 Community Edition (CC0), KSHarp mf samples (18, one layer), as shipped in the Virtual Playing
// Orchestra 3.2 wave archive (libs/VSCO2-CE/Strings/Harp). Written for sfzplay.py by actor 4. Velocity is gain only
// (amp_veltrack 100); the string rings on after note-off and is damped over ampeg_release. tune: the samples measure
// about 8 cents flat (r04/NOTES.md).
<group>
ampeg_attack=0.002 ampeg_release=2.0 amp_veltrack=100 tune=8
<region> sample=../../assets/vpo3/libs/VSCO2-CE/Strings/Harp/KSHarp_D2_mf.wav lokey=21 hikey=39 pitch_keycenter=38
